#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Write the current meal-plan day/week JSON for the Glance Meals page.

Recipes live in /var/lib/glance/recipes.json and the weekly rotation plus
shopping lists live in /var/lib/glance/meal-plan.json — both editable from
the Meals page (recipes, via glance-weight-server's /recipe/save and
/recipe/delete) rather than hardcoded here. On first run, whichever of
those files is missing gets seeded from SEED_RECIPES/SEED_PLAN below, so
the rotation that used to live in this script carries over automatically.
Seeding never overwrites an existing file, so live edits always persist.
Runs from a systemd timer.
"""
